---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---

<Base
  title="Sangha"
  description="About our community — practice schedule, locations, and how to get involved."
>
  <article class="prose prose-stone max-w-none">
    <h1 class="font-serif text-4xl text-stone-900">Our sangha</h1>
    <p class="text-lg text-stone-600 mt-4">
      Who we are, where we gather, and how to join us in practice.
    </p>

    <h2 class="font-serif text-2xl text-stone-900 mt-10">Practice schedule</h2>
    <p class="text-stone-700 mt-2">
      [List recurring sittings, study groups, and other regular gatherings.]
    </p>

    <h2 class="font-serif text-2xl text-stone-900 mt-10">Where we meet</h2>
    <p class="text-stone-700 mt-2">
      [Describe the meeting space, address, and any access notes.]
    </p>

    <h2 class="font-serif text-2xl text-stone-900 mt-10">Joining us</h2>
    <p class="text-stone-700 mt-2">
      New practitioners are always welcome. See the
      <a href="/contact" class="underline">contact page</a> to reach out before your first visit.
    </p>
  </article>
</Base>
